 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "The one invariant",
   "items": [
    "Every block is on the free list XOR has refcount > 0 (check_invariants)",
    "A block returns to the pool only when its refcount reaches 0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "Who holds references",
   "items": [
    "Each BlockTable that lists the block: one each",
    "The radix tree, once the block is published: one",
    "So refcount 1 + no table = only the cache keeps it alive",
    "Publish = tree increfs a full, computed block",
    "Release = finish or preempt calls table.free()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Interview angle",
   "items": [
    "Day 1 Q6: a shared block is freed only when the last holder lets go",
    "Day 1 Q7: allocate_many never leaks half an allocation"
   ]
  }
 ]
